{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prison Escape Simulator is a single-player parkour, action, adventure, escape, and survival game. Run, kill, hide, avoid deadly traps, explore endless mysterious escape routes, and escape the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The most exciting game of the year. It will bring out your fear of heights.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>1 Game 20 Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The cost is just a coffee <strong>\u2615</strong>, the adrenaline it gives is limitless.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story of the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're in the most secure prison in the world. You've been thrown into the dungeon. The prisoner is sentenced to death. His only chance is to escape from prison. Everything is in your hands. Survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Will you be able to escape from prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This survival-themed escape game will take your breath away. Experience an action-packed adventure and parkour challenge you can play endlessly. Explore the mysterious island and find your escape route. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Find your favorite weapon and fight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/8c27da588a986728314c3eb439c10dfa.poster.avif?t=1753695647\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/8c27da588a986728314c3eb439c10dfa.webm?t=1753695647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/8c27da588a986728314c3eb439c10dfa.mp4?t=1753695647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Exciting Parkour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy intense downhill parkour and show off your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/parkur.gif?t=1753695647\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Escape the maze</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way to escape the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/lab.gif?t=1753695647\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Learn to use a helicopter and boat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/parasut.gif?t=1753695647\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Unique Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the thrill of descending the mountain, monitor security cameras, immerse yourself in the story, fight with a variety of weapons, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy original music inspired by Hans Zimmer </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a unique adventure with unlimited different endings and countless escape routes every time you play. Add the game to your wishlist to be among the first to try this one-of-a-kind experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507120?t=1753695647","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/61ae08f78ede7ac022cba26ea60d2347359f5999/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753695647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/2db8b5aee3ea6cccd917a89a560e554ce3f39003/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753695647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/2db8b5aee3ea6cccd917a89a560e554ce3f39003/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753695647",